# Rootcellar Deep's root gallery and upper store (CIPlay rootcellar_deep_caves, 11-11 w06; in a test world 'CI ...').
# Points as in the recipe (25 m down, all flooded): two mouths in the hill's foot at -7.2 22.2 and -1.4 35, the drifts
# meeting at the junction -17.2 34.3, the chamber to -20.9 35.9, the ramp up from -18.5 36.5 to the upper store round
# -15.5 45.5 (air zone rc_upperstore, the farm's crate at -14.2 46.6). Heights are guesses: below= keeps to the floor.
island Rootcellar Deep keep
offset 0 0
hour 11
weather Calm

picture rc_cave_out -3 4 18 -10 2 25
picture rc_cave_out2 2.5 4 35 -6 2 35
walk -4.6 19.4 to -7.2 22.2 to -10.3 25.5 to -13.4 28.8 to -17.2 34.3 below=-2
picture rc_cave_junction -13.4 3 28.8 -20.9 2 35.9 light=20
walk -17.2 34.3 to -18.5 36.5 to -19 41 to -16.5 45 to -15.5 45.5 below=-2
air rc_upperstore here
picture rc_store_in -18.5 9 39 -14.5 8 46 light=20
open Upper store crate
wait 2
expect item Rope 2
air rc_upperstore

# Out by the other drift
at -17.2 34.3 h=2
wait 1
walk -17.2 34.3 to -10.6 35.2 to -1.44 34.96 to 2 35 below=-2
